{"unit_id":"tag:03QD:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHensel（henselian）局部环（local rings）的一个值得记住的例子是完备局部环（complete local rings）。回顾（《代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0001>），完备（complete）局部环（local ring）是局部环（local ring）<MATH_0001>，满足<MATH_0002>，即它对于<MATH_0003>-进拓扑（adic topology）完备（complete）且分离（separated）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"henselian","target_term":"Hensel"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"complete local rings","target_term":"完备局部环"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"adic topology","target_term":"进拓扑"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"henselian","target_term":"Hensel","context":"环的Hensel性质。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"complete local rings","target_term":"完备局部环","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备","context":"进拓扑的完备性。"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"adic topology","target_term":"进拓扑","context":"理想的进拓扑。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"进拓扑的分离性。"}],"notes":[]}
